From e2aa03a85076680a48ea815a3cb0f8e78752a61e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: forge-shepherd <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 11 Jul 2026 15:01:29 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] fix(dashboard): address 6 CodeRabbit review threads on #344
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- a11y (Major): cards/rows/area-nodes are click-only divs — give every
  non-native [data-act] element button semantics (role + tabindex) and
  handle Enter/Space (enhanceA11y + onActKeydown), plus a :focus-visible
  ring. Pure helpers isActivationKey/needsButtonSemantics exported + tested.
- a11y (Major): make the detail overlay an accessible modal — role="dialog",
  aria-modal, aria-label, tabindex on the panel; move focus in on open, trap
  Tab within it, and restore focus to the opener (or its re-rendered twin) on
  close, including deep-link opens.
- board (Minor): classify blocked work before claimed in the Kanban pool so a
  blocked+claimed issue stays in Ready with a ✕ glyph — matches columnOf()/Table.
- nav (Minor): Memory badge counts decisions (what the view renders), not plans.
- boot (Major): guard both localStorage access points in wireTheme so disabled
  storage (file://, private mode) can't throw before the baked snapshot renders.
- refresh (Minor): emit docs.json alongside docs.js and reload it in
  DataSource.refetch(), so edited/new work-folder markdown isn't stale until a
  full page reload.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
